abstract: >-
  Code, raw results and derived tables for an evaluation of eight tool-output
  checking strategies on AgentDojo v1.2.2 (slack and banking) with
  gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18, three seeds, two attacks, and a blocking-policy
  ablation.
